## StoryBrief

{
  "title": "Noir City",
  "premise": "A private investigator tracks a blackmailer through a rain-soaked city where every alibi is suspect.",
  "genre": "mystery",
  "tone": "noir",
  "location_count": 3,
  "constraints": [
    "forbid:gunpowder",
    "require:alibi"
  ]
}

## World

{
