.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Record verification","description":"Compares maintenance notes and crossing records against Warden procedures.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_sella_bram","name":"Sella Bram","role":"supporting","description":"Sella is a Hollow Circle miller whose family has supplied grain through both calm seasons and shifting winds. She attends the manor party to negotiate a fairer shipment arrangement, not to make friends with the Cartel. She is sturdy and broad-faced, with flour caught in the seams of her green sleeves and an easy laugh that disappears when someone speaks for the Circle without asking. She knows the guests' habits from preparing the gathering and is one of the first people Mira tries to cast suspicion upon.","motivation":"Keep the Circle's grain in local hands and prevent the levy from making the mills dependent on Cartel favor.","goal":"Leave the gathering with a fair shipment agreement and the Circle's reputation intact.","flaw":"Her fierce independence makes her refuse help even when shared effort would protect her neighbors.","internal_conflict":"Sella wants the Hollow Circle to stand together, but worries that compromise will let outsiders decide the terms of their survival.","external_conflict":"Oren's levy threatens the Circle's livelihood, and Mira's attempt to blame a local miller puts Sella and her community under suspicion.","arc":"Sella begins the weekend ready to reject every offer from the Cartel; after Oren's murder, Mira's accusation threatens to isolate her, so Sella chooses to share the Circle's shipment notes with Elowen and explain which records the millers keep collectively. She ends prepared to negotiate as a group, preserving independence without mistaking cooperation for surrender.","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","personality_traits":["forthright","generous","stubborn","community-minded"],"abilities":[{"name":"Mill operations","description":"Understands grain storage, milling schedules, and the practical details of local shipments.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Community organizing","description":"Brings neighbors together around shared work and collective decisions.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_elowen_mira","source_character_id":"chr_elowen_vale","target_character_id":"chr_mira_quill","relationship_type":"adversary","description":"Elowen investigates Oren's murder while Mira tries to redirect her questions toward the Hollow Circle."},{"id":"rel_mira_ivo","source_character_id":"chr_mira_quill","target_character_id":"chr_ivo_tarn","relationship_type":"former allies","description":"Mira and Ivo once worked together on toll records; their shared history gives Mira leverage and makes Ivo reluctant to reveal what he approved."},{"id":"rel_sella_oren","source_character_id":"chr_sella_bram","target_character_id":"chr_oren_pell","relationship_type":"opponents","description":"Sella resists Oren's grain levy, while Oren uses Cartel authority to pressure her community."},{"id":"rel_elowen_sella","source_character_id":"chr_elowen_vale","target_character_id":"chr_sella_bram","relationship_type":"friends","description":"Elowen and Sella trust one another as Hollow neighbors, though Sella challenges Elowen when she tries to protect the Circle without consulting it."},{"id":"rel_oren_mira","source_character_id":"chr_oren_pell","target_character_id":"chr_mira_quill","relationship_type":"uneasy colleagues","description":"Oren relies on Mira to keep the Cartel accounts, while Mira fears he will expose her falsifications."}]}
